  "reason": "Evidence: scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted (config_001, 0.725) is the clear best, and all scvi_n200+vit_l multiprofile variants are now tested. The remaining untested scvi_n200 multiprofile configs use resnet50, with avgpool+weighted (config_022) and avgpool+concat (config_041) still open. Weighted fusion has outperformed concat in 3 of 4 direct comparisons (transformer+vit_l, transformer+resnet50, and the overall pattern), and scvi_n200 is strongly preferred over other RNA encoders. This experiment tests whether the avgpool+resnet50+weighted combination can approach the top-performing regime, exploiting the best RNA encoder and fusion strategy while probing the one untested aggregation-image pairing in the multiprofile setting. As the final experiment, it maximizes expected accuracy among remaining options and provides a clean comparison point for the aggregation axis under the best RNA encoder."
